1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sven_Lagerbring
2 CONT
2 CONT Sven Lagerbring (originally Sven Bring; after being knighted, he wrote his name as Sven Lager Bring; 24 February 1707 – 5 December 1787) was a Swedish professor and historian. He has been described as "the first Swedish historian 
2 CONC in the modern sense."
2 CONT
2 CONT Lagerbring was a professor at Lund University. He initiated more modern, critical research in Swedish history alongside Olof von Dalin. He published a wide range of works, including the influential four-volume Swea rikes historia.
2 CONC  Lagerbring became a member of the Royal Swedish Academy of History and Antiquities in 1786.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.nad.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=10853
