2 GIVN Johan Fredrik
2 _MARNM von Kaulbars
1 NAME Johann Friedrich /von Kaulbars/
2 GIVN Johann Friedrich
2 SURN von Kaulbars
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 9 APR 1698
2 ADDR
3 CITY Erfurt
3 STAE Thüringen
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
2 DATE 16 DEC 1762
2 ADDR
3 CITY Gothenburg
3 CTRY Sweden
