2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Cecilia Blanxius Born about 1712 [location unknown] ANCESTORS ancestors Daughter of Ivar Blanxius and Helena Katrina Oelreich [sibling(s) unknown] Wife of Johannes Nicolaus Sundius — married 1738 [location unknown] DESCENDANTS des
2 CONC cendants Mother of Johannes Sundius, Ivar Sundius, Brita Christina Sundius, Mathias Sundius, Helena Catharina Sundius, Eva Maria Sundius, Maria Christina Sundius and Kristian Sundius Died 1789 [location unknown] Profile manager: E
2 CONC  Kippner  Profile last modified 30 May 2018
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography Cecilia was born about 1712. She married the vicar of Allerum and fleninge parishes, Johannes Sundius. She was his second wife. They had 9 children.
2 CONT
