2 CONT Johannes Nicolaus "Johan" Sundius Born 3 Mar 1699 in Helsingborg, Sverigemap Son of Johan Sundius and [mother unknown] Brother of Mathias Sundius and Magnus Sundius Husband of Katarina Dryselius — married 1729 [location unknown] H
2 CONC usband of Cecilia Blanxius — married 1738 [location unknown] DESCENDANTS descendants Father of Johannes Sundius, Ivar Sundius, Brita Christina Sundius, Mathias Sundius, Helena Catharina Sundius, Eva Maria Sundius, Maria Christina 
2 CONC Sundius and Kristian Sundius Died 18 Jun 1774 in Allerum, Malmöhus, Sverige
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography Johannes was born in 1699. He was the vicar of the Allerum and Fleininge parishes.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes married 1) Katrina Dryselius in 1729. She was the widow of his predecessor as vicar, Olof Helichii. Johannes married 2) Cecilia Blanxius in 1738. She was the daughter of his cousin Helena Oelreich.
2 CONT
2 CONT With his second wife, Cecilia Blanxius, he had 9 children. He passed away in 1774.
2 CONT
