2 CONC arion MacLean,   b. Duart, Isle Of Mull, Argyll, Scotland,   d. Yes, date unknown +	4. Mary MacLean,   d. Yes, date unknown +	5. dau. MacLean, of Duart (Dowart),   d. Yes, date unknown +	6. Janet MacLean,   b. Duart, Isle Of Mull,
