2 CONT * Death:	Jan 17 1844 - Linköping, Östergötland, Sverige
2 CONT * Parents:	Salomon Cronhielm, Margareta Lovisa Cronhielm (born Heijkenskjöld)
2 CONT * Wife:	Sofia Maria von Cronhielm (born Rosen)
2 CONT * Children:	(--stillborn--) Cronhielm, Lovisa Juliana Sofia Cronhielm, Carl Salomon Gustaf Cronhielm
2 CONT * Siblings:	Margareta Catharina Cronhielm, Charlotta Lovisa Cronhjelm, Carl Detlov Cronhielm, Anna Gustava Cronhjelm
2 CONT
