2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustaf_Wachtmeister '''Gustaf Wachtmeister'''] was a Swedish Army officer made famous at the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Valkeala Battle of Valkeala] in Finland in 1789 against Russia wh
2 CONC ere he was wounded by a musket shot to his arm, which had to be amputated. He was made the hero of the hour by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustav_III_of_Sweden '''King Gustav III'''] who was in desperate need of publicity as he
2 CONC  tried to silence domestic opposition with a crushing victory over Russia.
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
