2 CONC Heritage Family Trees] via mother [http://www.geni.com/profile-34647478774 Christina Hilda Cederström (born Wachtmeister Af Johannishus)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 4 2015, 16:47:26 UTC''
